title: Birthday
---
The cottage glows with candlelight. Mother has baked a honey cake, and Ros is bouncing on her toes. #line:bday_001
"Did you get me something? Did you, did you?" #line:bday_002
-> Give Ros her gift. #line:bday_opt_give
    <<set_flag gift_given>>
    Ros squeals and throws her arms around you. "It's perfect! You're the best!" #line:bday_ack_give
-> Keep the gift for yourself. #line:bday_opt_keep
    <<set_flag gift_kept>>
    Ros's face falls. She says nothing, but she doesn't look at you for the rest of supper. #line:bday_ack_keep
Later, as the candles gutter, Father goes to the window and goes very still. There is smoke rising from the woods. #line:bday_smoke
===
